      "text": "\n\n## Bogotá and Caño Cristales in one trip\n\nThis trip takes you to two very different parts of Colombia. Bogotá is a large, high-altitude city with a colonial centre, museums and the country's main square. La Macarena is the starting point for nature trails in the national park and visits to Caño Cristales.\n\nThe river is known for its clear water and the bright colours of its aquatic plants. It is often called the “River of Five Colours” or the “Rainbow River”. Conservation authorities determine which routes can be followed in the national park, so the order of visits may change.\n"
